# Docker build context excludes (ADR 0007). Keeps the image lean and the build
# reproducible: host node_modules, build artifacts, secrets, VCS, and tests
# never enter the image. The Dockerfile rebuilds the web bundle and installs
# fresh deps from the lockfile.

# Dependencies — reinstalled inside the image from the lockfile.
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts — the web bundle is rebuilt in the build stage.
**/dist
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets — never bake env into the image; prod uses env_file at runtime.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS + tooling
.git
.github
.gitignore

# Tests — not needed at runtime.
**/*.test.ts
**/test
**/coverage

# Editor / OS cruft
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Docker + compose files themselves
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
